T*
(DS-D2304 PAGE 2 OF 4 - PROCESS CONNECTIONS & RECIRCULATION LOOP) Tj
T*
(Equipment Tag: D-2304 \(Decomposer Reactor\)) Tj
T*
(- Feed Inlet \(Stream S229\): Concentrated 82 wt% CHP from Preflash Column V-2301 via Pump P-2301A/B \(14,500 kg/hr\)) Tj
T*
(- Catalyst Feed \(Stream S310\): Dilute Sulfuric Acid Catalyst \(180 ppmw H2SO4 in Acetone\) via Valve XV-1305) Tj
T*
(- Recirculation Outlet \(Stream S379\): 185,000 kg/hr reaction mixture to Circulation Pump P-2304A/B and Reactor Cooler E-2307) Tj
T*
(- Cooled Recirculation Return \(Stream S380\): Returns from Reactor Cooler E-2307 at 74 degC to maintain 12:1 recycle ratio) Tj
T*
(- Reactor Product Effluent \(Stream S384\): 14,500 kg/hr cleaved Phenol/Acetone product to Neutralization Drum D-2310 via LV-1301) Tj
T*
(- Emergency Quench Inlet \(Stream S387\): Cold Cumene Quench injection via Emergency Valve XV-1309) Tj
T*
ET
endstream
endobj
