T*
(DS-D2304 PAGE 3 OF 4 - SAFETY INSTRUMENTATION & OVERPRESSURE PROTECTION) Tj
T*
(Equipment Tag: D-2304) Tj
T*
(- Guided-Wave Radar Level Transmitter LT-1301: Range 0 to 4500 mm \(Normal Level 55%, LSHH 82%, LSLL 20%\), modulates LV-1301) Tj
T*
(- SIL-2 Voting Temperature Switch High-High TXSHH-1301 \(2oo3 voting TXSHH-1301A/B/C\):) Tj
T*
(  * High Alarm \(TAH\): 92.0 degC) Tj
T*
(  * High-High Trip Setpoint \(TXSHH\): 115.0 degC -> Activates Interlock I-2304 \(closes CHP feed, trips XV-1305 acid valve, opens XV-1309 emergency cumene quench\)) Tj
T*
(- Pressure Transmitter PT-1301: Range 0 to 15.0 kg/cm2g \(PAH at 3.2 kg/cm2g\)) Tj
T*
(- Pressure Safety Valves PSV-2304A / PSV-2304B:) Tj
T*
(  * Set Pressure: 11.0 kg/cm2g \(matches DS-D2304 Internal Design Pressure of 11.0 kg/cm2g\)) Tj
T*
(  * Orifice Size: 4J6 \(API 526\)) Tj
T*
(  * Relieving Case: Blocked Outlet / Runaway Two-Phase CHP Decomposition to Knock-Out Drum D-2320) Tj
T*
ET
